  "markdown": "[Skip to main content](https://avispl.com/solutions/reference-designs/#main-content)\n\n# Rapidlydeployablemeeting  roomsfeaturingleading  AVandUCsolutions\n\nScroll to bottom of the hero section\n\n![Woman speaks to colleagues in a modern meeting room with blue chairs, a plant, and two laptops.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Mobile_Room_Final.jpg)\n\nBased on our decades of meeting room experience and client success, we’ve curated and configured reference designs and best practices to help create your ideal digital workplace.\n\nRoom designs provide an equitable, accessible, and positive experience for all hybrid participants. We support your preferred UC platforms, such as [Microsoft Teams](https://avispl.com/microsoft/), [Cisco Webex](https://avispl.com/cisco/), [Zoom](https://avispl.com/zoom/), and [Google Meet](https://avispl.com/google/).\n\n[Contact us](https://avispl.com/solutions/reference-designs/#contact)\n\n### End-userandITbenefits\n\nMeeting room reference designs follow collaboration technology standards that save time for IT support staff and end users. When the same tools and applications are in all conference rooms, teams know how to use the solutions in every space.\n\nHelp desk teams also limit the number of solutions they need to support. Other benefits include increased productivity, better employee experience and satisfaction, and higher video adoption rates.\n\n- ###### Webex by Cisco\n\n- ###### Google meet\n\n- ###### Microsoft\n\n- ###### Zoom\n\n\n### ExploreOur  RoomDesigns\n\n![Woman speaks to colleagues in a modern meeting room with blue chairs, a plant, and two laptops.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Mobile_Room_Final.jpg)[Open image gallery](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Mobile_Room_Final.jpg)\n\n##### Mobile Collaboration Space\n\n![A diverse group in a modern conference room watches a video call on a screen, surrounded by minimalistic art and green chairs.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Small_Room_Final.jpg)[Open image gallery](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Small_Room_Final.jpg)\n\n##### Small Meeting Room\n\n![Three at a table video conference with six on screen; laptops, tablets present; large photo on wall.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Medium_Room_Final.jpg)[Open image gallery](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Medium_Room_Final.jpg)\n\n##### Medium Meeting Room\n\n![Five people at a white table with laptops in a virtual meeting; NYC skyline picture on the wall, screen shows participants.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Large_Room_Final.jpg)[Open image gallery](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Large_Room_Final.jpg)\n\n##### Large Conference Room\n\n![Modern classroom with 6 people at blue chairs, facing a screen with virtual meeting; laptops open, well-lit room, white walls.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Classroom_Final.jpg)[Open image gallery](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Classroom_Final.jpg)\n\n##### Classroom and Training Room\n\n15\n\n![Leaf](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1218937824262680.paT5NtQ6kFsURkitGvv7_height640.png)\n\n### Sustainability-Screened Meeting Room Reference Designs\n\n![](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TeamMeetingRoom-2.png)\n\nGlobal meeting room technology standards designed to reduce your carbon footprint.\n\n- [**Logitech** \\\\\n\\\\\nAVI-SPL has partnered with Logitech to develop efficient, sustainability-screened meeting room designs minimize your environmental footprint. They’re available now and can be easily deployed globally.](https://avispl.com/solutions/reference-designs/sustainability-screened-meeting-rooms/)\n- ###### COMING SOON\n\n\n\n\nWe’re working with our partners to build more eco-friendly reference designs.\n\n\n### Real-Time Design\n\nAVI-SPL’s Real-Time Design approach uses 3D visualizations to help you validate designs and technology integrations before you invest in and build them.\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/services/real-time-design/)\n\n### Meeting Room Design Considerations\n\n![Four people in a modern conference room, round table, video call screen, colorful walls, large windows showing a building.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Neat-Center-1.png)\n\n#### Interoperability\n\nDeliver a native platform experience across your preferred solutions.\n\n#### Ease of Use\n\nMake meeting effortless with technology standards, automation, and simple control UIs.\n\n#### AI-Powered Technology\n\nDeploy the latest tools, including devices, software, translations, summaries, and note-taking.\n\n#### Sustainability\n\nChoose technology providers that support company sustainability goals.\n\n## Accessibilityand  ADAstandards\n\nWhen outfitting meeting rooms, integrating AV, and deploying UC applications, designs should follow the latest ADA Standards to ensure accessibility for all team members. AVI-SPL’s design and engineering teams can help you ensure everyone can use your collaboration spaces and tools. Top considerations include:\n\n- ###### Furniture placement and clearance\n\n- ###### Keeping room controls within everyone’s reach\n\n- ###### Touch-less interfaces like voice control and mobile apps\n\n- ###### Options for team members with hearing and vision challenges\n\n- ###### Enabling remote attendees to be seen and heard clearly by everyone in the room, and on-site employees can see and hear virtual attendees",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en-GB\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<body class=\"wp-singular page-template-default page page-id-2317 page-parent page-child parent-pageid-307 wp-custom-logo wp-theme-avi-spl\" style=\"\">\n<!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n\n<div class=\"skip-link\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n    \t<a class=\"skip-link__btn\" href=\"https://avispl.com/solutions/reference-designs/#main-content\" aria-label=\"Skip to main content\">Skip to main content</a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\t<main id=\"main\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<section class=\"hero page-block hero--x-small\">\n    \n                        <div class=\"hero__content\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0%);\">\n                <div class=\"container\">\n                                                               <h1 data-splitting=\"words\" class=\"words splitting\" style=\"--word-total: 10; opacity: 1;\"><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"Rapidly\" style=\"--word-index: 0; clip-path: none;\"><span style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">Rapidly</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"deployable\" style=\"--word-index: 1;\"><span>deployable</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"meeting\" style=\"--word-index: 2;\"><span>meeting</span></span> <br><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"rooms\" style=\"--word-index: 3;\"><span>rooms</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"featuring\" style=\"--word-index: 4;\"><span>featuring</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"leading\" style=\"--word-index: 5;\"><span>leading</span></span> <br><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"AV\" style=\"--word-index: 6;\"><span>AV</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"and\" style=\"--word-index: 7;\"><span>and</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"UC\" style=\"--word-index: 8;\"><span>UC</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"solutions\" style=\"--word-index: 9;\"><span>solutions</span></span></h1>\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    <button class=\"hero__scroll scroll-btn scroll-btn--o scroll-to-main\" aria-label=\"Scroll to bottom of the hero section\" title=\"Scroll to bottom of the hero section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t    <span class=\"sr-only\">Scroll to bottom of the hero section</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            </section>\n<div id=\"main-content\"></div>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"intro-image-text page-block intro-image-text--hyacinth intro-image-text--no-grid\" role=\"region\">\n\t<span class=\"intro-image-text__bg\"><span class=\"intro-image-text__bg__inner\"></span></span>\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"intro-image-text__image\">\n\t\t    <img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1382\" height=\"778\" src=\"https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Mobile_Room_Final.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Woman speaks to colleagues in a modern meeting room with blue chairs, a plant, and two laptops.\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 160px);\">\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"intro-image-text__text\">\n                                    \t<div class=\"body-content\">\n                \t<p>Based on our decades of meeting room experience and client success, we’ve curated and configured reference designs and best practices to help create your ideal digital workplace.</p>\n<p>Room designs provide an equitable, accessible, and positive experience for all hybrid participants. We support your preferred UC platforms, such as <a href=\"https://avispl.com/microsoft/\">Microsoft T